Ah yes, the temperature's coming down, the leaves are starting to turn red, and you still didn't find your summer love, which can mean only one thing:

00:00:53.180 --> 00:01:01.260
The new season of anime is just about to start. Where you can forget all your sorrows with some cute anime girls. Or guys, we don't judge here.

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:05.260
In our community, we are all believers of equality...

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.800
...In degeneracy

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:15.200
Now, as your friendly neighborhood "anime" "watcher", it's my jobs to go through all the "anime" this new season so you don't have to.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:24.560
And who knows? Maybe we'll both find a gem we can get excited about, follow religiously, then watch as it slowly disappoints us and drops all the hype you held at the beginning.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:27.680
Let's start off with everyone's favourite...

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:31.380
"Cooking show"

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:37.100
Now, I know what you're thinking. 
"What spicy new dishes are they're gonna give us this season"

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:46.840
'cause, you know, that's the best part of the show. Seeing how they're able to handle their "fresh meat" into new, interesting dishes and nothing. Else.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:52.780
Speaking of sequels I'll definitely be watching, "Kekkai Sensen" has picked up exactly where it left off and holy shit!

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:58.300
If I had a boner before, this scene has definitely finished it off. Thank you again

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:06.420
I'm glad to see that it's still full of character and as stylish as ever. So yeah, not much to add if you've already seen the first season except god, I miss the old ending.

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:10.680
Not that the new ones are bad but can we just agree that this was one of the best ED's in recent memory?

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.940
You know normally I wouldn't give a show like this a second look, but thanks to "Made in Abyss"

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:21.180
I'm now obligated to check out every show about chibi explorers, on the off chance that they'll turn out amazing.

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:27.780
It was atmospheric, it was cute, and the world seems interesting so you know what I might actually give this one a-

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.500
Wait, hold on a second, did- did they just...?

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.200
So as I was saying, the show is awful and giving it a chance was a massive mistake.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:41.940
"Hey"

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:45.180
"Wanna hear the most annoying sound in the world?"

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:56.080
*Asta screaming*

00:02:57.520 --> 00:03:02.220
So "Black Clover" was hyped up as being one of the possible new big shonen's of this generation and

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:05.240
HA HA HA ha ha ha ha ha...

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:10.180
So far, it's been an absolute mess. Not even counting the main character's fucking constant

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:11.380
*Asta SCREAM*

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:18.560
It's as generic a shonen can be right now, and it feels like the show is 10 years old and has much more in common with titles in the era of The Big 3

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.660
rather than how the genre has slowly evolved in recent times.

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:27.240
at the moment, it's just a very poor man's "Naruto," or an equally wealthy man's "Fairy Tale"

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:30.320
A moment of silence, please, for the comment section.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:34.280
*in the distance* "Did he just imply "Fairy Tale" was bad!?"

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:39.660
In the same way that "My Hero Academia" shows us how we can take every generic shonen trope and refine it to a T,

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:44.900
"Black Clover" has shown us how we can take every generic shonen trope and make it completely generic.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:54.080
The main character is annoying as hell, we were given the fucking flashback in episode 2, nothing about this show is special so far, and you know the part that pisses me off the most?

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:57.240
I'm still probably gonna watch anyway 'cause I'm shonen trash.

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:01.760
So "Inuyashiki" marks the second manga on my recommended manga video to be adapted by Mapper.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:05.040
But I was honestly a bit disappointed in this first episode.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:11.940
The pacing was lightning fast and we weren't given enough time to actually care about these characters or let the consequences of any actions sink in.

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:14.200
It feels like this should have been two episodes worth of material, but it is just the first episode after all

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:20.800
and every seasonal anime has to start off with a bang so I still have high hopes for this

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:27.620
If anything, I can thank you for letting Man with a Mission complete their Holy Trinity of Hype-as-Balls one-liner anime openings.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.460
♪ Raise your flag - Man with a Mission ♪

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:31.460
♪ database - Man with a Mission ♪

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:36.620
♪ My Hero - Man with a Mission ♪

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:41.860
I feel like after "Eromanga Sensei", I've been given kind of a bad rep when it comes to little sisters in anime.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:43.380
For some reason, I really can't tell.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.320
As a lot of you have been telling me to watch this new Imouto anime

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:50.840
but, I mean, after "Eromanga Sensei," I really don't know what new things can be done.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:25.500
"You always ignore me now! You never listen to what I have to say, what's going o-!?"

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:31.100
*Gigguk sighs*

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.980
Wait a minute, this is just the first two minutes of the episode!

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:59.000
OH! I... I see, it's- it's- it's the good old incest bait-and-switch! the oldest- The oldest trick in the book...

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:03.650
It's about a light novel author obsessed with writing light novels about little sisters.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:09.620
So I assume this is the memoirs of the "Eromanga Sensei" author because I can definitely see where the inspiration comes from.

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:16.060
It's been 14 years since the last "Kino's Journey" so I'm guessing a bunch of you new anime fans

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:22.800
So I'm guessing a bunch of you newer anime fans will have never heard of it so I'm just gonna pull out my old fag card and say watch this first episode.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:27.800
It's an episodic show, so you don't need to watch the original, all you need to know is that it's about a girl travelling to different countries

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:32.180
each with different rules and laws that explore interesting philosophies and mentalities

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:40.100
The first episode looks at what could possibly happen if there was a country where the act of murder was legal. The original anime was great, and this one's looking like you'll be good too.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.720
Wait a minute. This is Negima.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:45.380
Why is this Negima? Is this new Negima? Oh I've not heard of this before!?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:51.320
♪ Happy Material - Touta Konoe ♪

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:57.300
Back in the day, when I was just but a teenager, I was enamored by the works of Ken Akamatsu, the harem God at the time

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:04.680
and his works like "Love Hina" and "Negima!" still hold a close place in my heart as they helped shape me to the man I am today.

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.120
*Guy sneezes*

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:08.000
*... and that happens*

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.200
I regret nothing

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:13.000
The "Negima!" manga though, ended up turning into an awesome shonen battle series

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:16.480
So excuse me while I squeal in nostalgia because they used the original OP

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:19.900
And there's Negi! And there's all the girls! And Ava's gone full kiss-shot and-

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:23.080
WHAT!?
[WHAT?!]

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:23.940
WHAT!?!?

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.940
WHAT THE FUCK JUST HAPPENED?!
[I DON'T KNOW!]

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:28.100
"Everybody clap your hands."

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:35.720
*Jaden clapping*

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:39.240
*Jaden clapping*
[Still going...]

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:45.320
*Jaden begins clapping again."

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:50.600
So we have a tournament where twelve Super-powered combatants fight to the death and the winner gets their wish granted.

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:53.940
Isn't this just "Fate?" Isn't this just "Fate" with edge?

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.540
Isn't this just "Fate" with a lot of fucking edge??

00:07:56.540 --> 00:08:02.200
I mean it looks fun as hell and the fight choreography is great, but let's be real here: This is just "Edge/stay night"

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:09.760
And hell, that isn't even clearly the edgiest show of the season because we've got a group of super-powered Nazis led by a charismatic leader trying to bring down the world's destruction.

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.460
That's right! It's "Akame Ga Hitler!"

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:16.980
The brakes don't stop on this edge train though because next we've got "Evil or Live."

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:20.940
That's right, in this cruel world where you're given two choices:

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.380
You can either live.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.720
or... you evil *chuckles*

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.080
*chuckling* what the fuck does that even mean?

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.320
*Anime girl grunting with exhaustion*

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.620
*and somehow trips on a pebble and face-plants.*

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:48.880
And finally, if there just wasn't enough edge this season, we have "King's Game." where you have a show with all the ingredients to bake that perfect edge cake!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:54.020
See, what you want to do is start off with your standard death game base, sprinkle in some exploding bodies,

00:08:54.020 --> 00:09:00.560
mix in some suicide with just a dash of rape. Now, put it in the oven and let it sit for about season and voila!

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:07.060
You've just baked yourself a nice new- shit... Oi! Who gave me the "Mirai Nikki" ingredients list?!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:10.880
So there's an anime called "Just Because" why?

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:13.120
I- just- just- just fucking because, okay?

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:17.900
But~ after the first episode, I have no idea what the show is actually about so let's just read the synopsis.

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:24.280
"At the end of the second semester of 3rd year of high school, four students are prepared for graduation and feel the ending to their high-school life.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:28.060
But that changes a little with the arrival of a transfer student."

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:32.720
Okay, I still have no idea what the show is actually about.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:37.120
All right guv'na! We in London now! 5 million pounds?

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.520
Is this how much the pounds gone down after Brexit!?

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:47.400
Wait a minute, I've lived in London, this ain't fucking West London.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:52.460
Unless... is this the legendary Zone 6 I've heard so much about?

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:58.360
Wait, are those... Yeah, they are! What are they doing in London?! Bloody immigrants!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:02.540
Alright, so this is looking like the newest hot show of the season and I can wholly see why.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:11.680
It has the same vibe and appeal of something like Harry Potter, with a world of mystique, mages and magic that you want to explore and learn more of without being in any way a ripoff.

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:19.140
So far, there hasn't really been a hook in the plot or with anything going on, but the atmosphere and setting have certainly intrigued me as I just want to see more of this world.

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.660
So yeah, with all the things considered, the season is looking up!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:27.860
We got some great sequels, some good originals, and a mix of fun ones; so yeah, that's Fall 2017.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:31.340
There's nothing else literally that's left to talk about!

00:10:31.340 --> 00:10:32.220
At all!

