00:10:55.280 --> 00:11:00.460
I don't think this counts as a terror attack because ISIS haven't claimed responsibility for this...

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:05.620
Maybe this is just Japan's declaration of war...

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:09.220
against humanity...

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:11.820
If this can get a second season, then this is it.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:16.460
This is the final proof we need to confirm that we are on the darkest timeline

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:20.160
